            "panel_footnote": "* Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.",
            "callout_1_title": "Why D3 + K2 together?",
            "callout_1_body": "Research increasingly points to their relationship in supporting where calcium actually ends up in the body. Vitamin D3 without K2 is a conversation half finished.",
